---
import CaseSection
  from "../components/case-study/CaseSection.astro";

import CaseMedia
  from "../components/case-study/CaseMedia.astro";
---

<CaseSection
  number="01"
  label="Context"
  title="Turning product ideas into interfaces stakeholders could understand."
>
  <p>
    The final version will explain the context of the
    pitch-deck work and the role the interface concepts
    played in communicating proposed functionality.
  </p>
</CaseSection>


<section
  class="site-container grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2"
>
  <CaseMedia
    label="Concept 01"
    caption="Placeholder for pitch-deck interface concept."
    ratio="landscape"
    tone="green"
  />

  <CaseMedia
    label="Concept 02"
    caption="Placeholder for another dashboard or product concept."
    ratio="landscape"
    tone="light"
  />
</section>


<CaseSection
  number="02"
  label="Translation"
  title="Moving from product requirements to presentation-ready interface concepts."
>
  <p>
    This part can eventually describe how requirements
    were interpreted visually, how information was
    prioritized, and how concepts evolved for
    presentation.
  </p>
</CaseSection>


<section class="site-container">
  <CaseMedia
    label="Pitch deck sequence"
    caption="Placeholder for a horizontal sequence of selected screens."
    ratio="wide"
    tone="dark"
  />
</section>


<CaseSection
  number="03"
  label="Collaboration"
  title="Working between design requirements and technical considerations."
>
  <p>
    The final section can discuss collaboration with
    the IT team and any relevant technical input while
    remaining precise about the actual scope of the
    work.
  </p>
</CaseSection>